**Short answer:** Kenneth Reitz wrote most of the surviving code, but the last commit was 2024-07-09, so ask Dana Okafor about `records.py`. Everything below comes from `git blame` (`-w -M -C`) with the formatting commits excluded. It counts surviving lines, not commits.

I excluded `abe2ea7` (black) and `0e8fe2e` (pre-commit bot). They reformatted about 19 lines in `records.py` and would otherwise credit Priya Raman and the bot with code they only reformatted. With them excluded, Priya has no surviving logic in `records.py`.

